  "title": "Instagram Expands Horizontally Video Features for Longform Content",
  "summary": "Instagram is introducing a new feature to allow users to watch longform horizontal videos, which could include content like news, sports, and documentaries. The platform is also experimenting with longer video formats, though it has previously resisted such changes.",
